# format=FAST
# Maretron ALM100 (product code 8165, sw 1.0.6) at source 164, WHILE SOUNDING.
# Captured on Dirk Wahrheit's bus with N2KView driving the annunciator for a real
# alarm. This is the state 130824 was never previously observed in.
#
# While the annunciator sounds, 130824 changes from its idle 00 00 ff ff ff ff ff
# to 00 64 04 00 17 0d 50 and its rate rises from one frame per 10s to 1 Hz.
# The last two bytes, 0d 50, are alert id 20493 little-endian -- the very alert
# that was active in 130819/126983 at the time. So the annunciator reports which
# alert it is sounding for.
#
# The 126208 Acknowledge group function the device emits confirms 130824 carries
# exactly 5 parameters, matching field4..field8.
